{"strongs": "H7834", "word": "שַׁ֫חַק", "translit": "sha.chaq", "root": "שחק", "morph": "H:N-M", "pos": "noun masculine", "gloss": "dust, cloud", "definition": "שַׁ֫חַק noun masculine Prov 9:20 dust, cloud (as fine, thin); — ׳ שׁ absolute Ps 89:7 ; Ps 89:38 , construct Isa 40:15 plural שְׁחָקִים Deut 33:25 +; — 1. fine dust , מאֹזְנַיִם ׳ שׁ Isa 40:15 (simile of insignificance). 2. (thin) cloud , usually plural (often || שָׁמַיִם ), Deut 33:26 (poem), Isa 45:8 ; Jer 51:9 ; Job 35:5 ; Job 36:28 ; Job 37:21 ; Job 38:37 ; Ps 36:6 ; Ps 57:11 ; Ps 68:35 ; Ps 77:18 ; Ps 78:23 ; Ps 108:5 opposed to תְּהוֺם Prov 3:20 ; Prov 8:28 ׳ עָבֵי שׁ 2Sam 22:12 = Ps 18:12 = heavens, sky Job 37:18 (with חִרְקִיעַ ), and (singular) Ps 89:7 ; Ps 89:38 . שִׁחֹר see שִׁיחוֺר .", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB8602')\">BDB8602</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H7834')\">H7834</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB8601')\">BDB8601</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB8603')\">BDB8603</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>שַׁ֫חַק</bdbheb> <b>noun masculine</b><sup><checkingNeeded/><ref ref=\"Prov 9:20\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(20,9,20)\">Prov 9:20</ref></sup> <highlightword>dust, cloud</highlightword> (as fine, thin); — <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>שׁ</bdbheb> absolute <ref ref=\"Ps 89:7\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"89\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"89\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(19,89,7)\">Ps 89:7</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 89:38\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"89\" vBegin=\"38\" cEnd=\"89\" vEnd=\"38\" onclick=\"bcv(19,89,38)\">Ps 89:38</ref>, construct <ref ref=\"Isa 40:15\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"40\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"40\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(23,40,15)\">Isa 40:15</ref> plural <bdbheb>שְׁחָקִים</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Deut 33:25\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"33\" vBegin=\"25\" cEnd=\"33\" vEnd=\"25\" onclick=\"bcv(5,33,25)\">Deut 33:25</ref> +; — <div class=\"point\"><b>1.</b> <highlight>fine dust</highlight>, <bdbheb>מאֹזְנַיִם</bdbheb> <bd